<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Tan Yu group plans to set up a bank.</title>
<headline>Philippine Tan Yu group plans to set up a bank.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine's Tan Yu Group of Companies has applied for a license to put up a commercial bank, Central Bank governor Gabriel Singson said on Monday.</p>
<p>Singson told reporters the Central Bank is still evaluating the application filed two to three months ago.</p>
<p>The Tan Yu Group of Companies is engaged primarily in real estate development.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
